# Build output is produced on Vercel, never uploaded from here.
#
# This machine syncs the Desktop to iCloud, which duplicates directories
# mid-operation ("out/blog 7", ".next/build 3"). A production deploy failed
# with ENOENT when one of those copies vanished between the CLI listing the
# file and reading it. Excluding generated output removes the race and makes
# the upload smaller.
out
.next
